    <briefdescription>
<para>Task for static metadata tables (snapshots, history). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds the metadata captured for a table scan; readers produce Arrow batches on demand. The metadata and its nested objects must not be modified while this task or its streams are in use. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
